al FC Points distribution by June 15, 2026 to receive all 6,000 FC Points. If you redeem after September 15, 2026, you will not receive any FC Points.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n‡Conditions & restrictions apply. See ea.com/games/ea-sports-fc/fc-26/game-disclaimers for details.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nText and audio commentary for languages other than English and the selected Steam client language requires a separate download.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe World's Game Edition & FC Points purchase are not available in Belgium and South Korea.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n§ Picks pulled from Knockout Royalty, Fantasy FC, FUT Birthday, Answer the Call and UEFA Road to the Final.<br />\r\n§§ Picks pulled from Knockout Royalty, Fantasy FC, FUT Birthday and Trophy Titans.<br />\r\n§§§ Picks include 1 player from each of; Argentina, Brazil, Canada, England, France, Germany, Mexico, Netherlands, Portugal, Saudi Arabia, Spain, USA.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n© 2025 Electronic Arts Inc. Electronic Arts, EA, EA SPORTS, the EA SPORTS logo, EA SPORTS FC, the EA SPORTS FC logo, Frostbite, the Frostbite logo, Football Ultimate Team, and Ultimate Team are trademarks of Electronic Arts Inc.", "drm_notice": "EA online activation and EA app software installation and background use required. Denuvo Anti-tamper", "developers": ["EA Canada", "EA Romania"], "publishers": ["Electronic Arts"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 6999, "final": 6999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$69.99"}, "packages": [1204710, 1305297, 1305364, 1305334, 1305333, 1305295, 1305373, 1305348, 1305296], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy EA SPORTS FC™ 26", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1204710, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "EA SPORTS FC™ 26 - $69.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_l